{"id":"n76177-2-8","stage":4,"title":"진흙 · 泥","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76177-2-8-1","ko":"이 많은 진흙을 어디에 쓰시려고요?","zh":"这么多泥巴，您打算用在哪里呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"진흙을","meaning":"泥","explanation":"진흙：泥；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"진흙","audio":"/audio/b9313d9fd0ec9bf6ddea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76177","senseId":"2","lemma":"진흙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진흙을","audio":"/audio/cb6107a8dc3d91a9bc84.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰시려고요?","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；려고요：礼貌地说明打算，或根据语调询问对方意图。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰시려고요","audio":"/audio/78a3af0f97c7e241b534.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"b9313d9fd0ec9bf6","term":"진흙","zh":"泥","audio":"/audio/b9313d9fd0ec9bf6ddea.mp3","entryId":"76177","definition":"水分很多，和得很粘稠的土。","pronunciation":["진흑"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac29fecdad0b4b03614c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76177-2-8-2","ko":"아, 이것으로 항아리를 만들 겁니다.","zh":"啊，要用这些来制作陶罐啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"이것으로","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것으로","audio":"/audio/04d003c286eb2366cdb7.mp3"}},{"text":"항아리를","meaning":"罐，缸，坛子","explanation":"항아리：罐，缸，坛子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"항아리","audio":"/audio/9fac85098277be9a84db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85902","senseId":"1","lemma":"항아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항아리를","audio":"/audio/41465f4e7f0f434b370b.mp3"}},{"text":"만들","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","